><li>1 * Gigabit network card, support PXE and network wake-up functions</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/x99-ds4-intel-lga-2011-v3-intel-b85-chipset-full-atx-server-motherboard\">X99-DS4 Intel LGA 2011-V3 Intel B85 Chipset Full ATX Server Motherboard</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">20,000৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">22,000৳</span> \n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/x99-xd3-intel-lga-2011-v3-intel-c612-chipset-micro-atx-server-motherboard\">X99-XD3 Intel LGA 2011-V3 Intel C612 Chipset Micro-ATX Server Motherboard</a></td>\n                 